@startuml
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
participant "SGW-C" as SGWC
participant "PGW-C" as PGWC
participant "PGW-U" as PGWU
participant "PCRF" as PCRF
participant "AF\n(P-CSCF)" as AF
participant "OCS" as OCS

== Rx Service Information ==
AF -> PCRF: Diameter (Rx): AA-Request (AAR)
PCRF -> AF: Diameter (Rx): AA-Answer (AAA)

== Gx PCC Rule Provisioning ==
note over PCRF: Session binding and PCC rule authorization
PCRF -> PGWC: Diameter (Gx): Re-Auth-Request (RAR)
PGWC -> PCRF: Diameter (Gx): Re-Auth-Answer (RAA)

== Gy Credit Request ==
opt Online charging applies to the new charging key
    PGWC -> OCS: Diameter (Gy): Credit-Control-Request (CCR-U)
    OCS -> PGWC: Diameter (Gy): Credit-Control-Answer (CCA-U)
end

== Dedicated Bearer Activation ==
PGWC -> PGWU: PFCP: Session Modification Request
PGWU -> PGWC: PFCP: Session Modification Response
PGWC -> SGWC: GTPv2: Create Bearer Request
ref over SGWC: Dedicated bearer activation\nbetween the SGW-C, MME, eNodeB, and UE
SGWC -> PGWC: GTPv2: Create Bearer Response
PGWC -> PGWU: PFCP: Session Modification Request
PGWU -> PGWC: PFCP: Session Modification Response

== Resource Allocation Report ==
PGWC -> PCRF: Diameter (Gx): Credit-Control-Request (CCR-U)
PCRF -> PGWC: Diameter (Gx): Credit-Control-Answer (CCA-U)
opt AF subscribed to the successful resource allocation
    PCRF -> AF: Diameter (Rx): Re-Auth-Request (RAR)
    AF -> PCRF: Diameter (Rx): Re-Auth-Answer (RAA)
end
@enduml
